[5892]={["aftermath"]="The quartermaster accepted the recovered supplies for the camp's use.",["atomIDs"]={"5892:description:1-84","5892:description:87-268","5892:description:273-309","5892:description:312-354","5892:objective:1-71"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5892:completion:1-10","5892:completion:12-47","5892:completion:49-59"},["opening"]="Dun Baldar's supplies had been stored at Irondeep before the fighting began. With troops committed against the Horde, the quartermaster could no longer keep guards over the mine's rising troggs or its stockpiles.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover ten loads of Irondeep supplies for Dun Baldar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Irondeep supplies to the Stormpike quartermaster.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="5bae371a6c2a4cf61129f40f37430de481b99a5eefe26c6ad0a382020a318f2a",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5893]={["aftermath"]="The quartermaster considered the musty stores usable and important to maintaining the fighting force.",["atomIDs"]={"5893:description:1-220","5893:description:223-308","5893:description:313-347","5893:description:350-402","5893:description:405-488","5893:objective:1-72"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5893:completion:1-17","5893:completion:19-32","5893:completion:34-150","5893:completion:155-168","5893:completion:170-232"},["opening"]="Coldtooth had once been convenient storage for the Frostwolves. Fighting the Stormpikes left too few warriors to hold it, and control shifted between the Alliance and the creatures underground. The stores were still needed at Frostwolf Keep.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover ten Coldtooth supply loads for the Frostwolves.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the Coldtooth supplies to the Frostwolf quartermaster.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="87da022e77b12902ba2a386d1ae3e546ae3461fca6ab8e573dff11ca4b0ad1d9",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5901]={["atomIDs"]={"5901:description:1-105","5901:description:107-239","5901:description:241-261","5901:description:266-331","5901:description:333-404","5901:description:406-436","5901:objective:1-71","5901:objective:73-177"},["opening"]="Mickey aimed to damage the Crusade's lumber supply. The scheme began with gathering termites from Plaguewood into a supplied jar.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather one hundred Plagueland termites.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the collected termites to Mickey.",["sourceHash"]="1a1c9dfaf0c421abbb39c250425c9455738741a7c13e0368a03b91c9d0f26006",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5902]={["aftermath"]="The termites grew restless as the barrel was set on a crate inside the mill.",["atomIDs"]={"5902:description:1-191","5902:description:196-303","5902:description:308-362","5902:description:364-418","5902:objective:1-134"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5902:completion:1-88"},["opening"]="Mickey packed the termites into a reinforced barrel. It was to be opened high in the center of Northridge's mill so the insects could spread.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to position the barrel inside the mill.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} placed the termite barrel at Northridge.",["sourceHash"]="3d671f67172482ab8a9a8fa205b7e714b8f1affe9616509479032bd3460487cc",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5903]={["atomIDs"]={"5903:description:1-91","5903:description:93-163","5903:description:168-283","5903:description:288-401","5903:description:403-503","5903:objective:1-71","5903:objective:73-186"},["opening"]="Force had repeatedly failed Nathaniel against the Crusade. He chose termites that survived plague and Scourge as the weapon for an assault on its lumber supply.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather one hundred Plaguewood termites.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the collected insects to Nathaniel.",["sourceHash"]="2d25a4803146dd750ade01d72050e0c6730aa37b14fd07bf1085a5d8d66e2018",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5904]={["aftermath"]="The insects were visibly restless as the barrel settled on a crate.",["atomIDs"]={"5904:description:1-185","5904:description:190-310","5904:description:312-397","5904:objective:1-134"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5904:completion:1-88"},["opening"]="The termites were secured in a reinforced barrel. Nathaniel directed its placement at the mill's center, expecting the released insects to make the timber works useless.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to position the barrel inside Northridge.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} placed the barrel in the mill.",["sourceHash"]="3af526e29a4ee4bd750196a5f844cf25502f493cc46f97942d61c69ba2356d22",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5921]={["aftermath"]="Dendrite began the teaching of the bear, leaving the pupil to embrace and sustain that understanding.",["atomIDs"]={"5921:description:1-185","5921:description:188-298","5921:description:301-358","5921:description:363-485","5921:description:488-510","5921:objective:1-59","5921:objective:62-137"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5921:completion:1-18","5921:completion:20-35","5921:completion:37-54","5921:completion:59-121","5921:completion:123-160","5921:completion:165-235","5921:completion:237-380"},["opening"]="Mathrengyl welcomed druids to Moonglade despite the tensions between Staghelm and Remulos. A newly taught transport spell would take the pupil to Dendrite for the first lesson in the bear's way.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to teleport to Nighthaven and speak with Dendrite.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} used the Moonglade spell and met Dendrite Starblaze.",["sourceHash"]="bd514f3186603fdbaa43e0093ff689ee3917cbbf18cfc6d46e417142328b2cb3",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5922]={["aftermath"]="Dendrite set the first lesson on the bear's perspective and the responsibility to make it part of druidic life.",["atomIDs"]={"5922:description:1-85","5922:description:88-175","5922:description:178-288","5922:description:291-348","5922:description:353-475","5922:description:478-500","5922:objective:1-59","5922:objective:62-137"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5922:completion:1-18","5922:completion:20-35","5922:completion:37-54","5922:completion:59-121","5922:completion:123-160","5922:completion:165-235","5922:completion:237-380"},["opening"]="Turak described Moonglade as a refuge open to tauren and night elf alike under Remulos's care. He offered the transport spell and sent the pupil to Dendrite for instruction.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to reach Moonglade by spell and find Dendrite.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} teleported to Moonglade and spoke with Dendrite.",["sourceHash"]="589d7c98b37eda9cbd8a5f670ef1aa99464349aed0a3b077c0cb9eb8adc7a5c4",["sourceRaceMask"]="32",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[5923]={["aftermath"]="Mathrengyl described service to nature and the balance druids preserve, then named the bear as the first lesson in strength of body and heart.",["atomIDs"]={"5923:description:1-20","5923:description:25-129","5923:description:132-241","5923:description:244-377","5923:description:382-480","5923:objective:1-68"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"5923:completion:1-40","5923:completion:42-50","5923:completion:52-123","5923:completion:128-189","5923:completion:191-248","5923:completion:250-339","5923:completion:341-454","5923:completion:459-473"},["opening"]="Denatharion carried word that Mathrengyl wished to train the pupil personally. The Arch Druid's assistant waited in the Cenarion Enclave of Darnassus.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to seek Mathrengyl in the enclave.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus.",["sourceHash"]="93e4484ac3e97ad75ba8d203307b9403989caade446e957c72a75238875ccd83",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
