[5981]={["atomIDs"]={"5981:description:1-117","5981:description:119-182","5981:description:187-282","5981:description:284-369","5981:description:374-477","5981:objective:1-81"},["opening"]="Rivern linked the frostsabers' ancient alliance to Tyrande's rescue of their queen. Frostmaul giants still occupied the southern valley, making an old danger the target of a new loyalty test.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront four giants and four preservers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Rivern's giant assignment.",["sourceHash"]="63bda0d781dcbf38c95259e3ceeed43fb31ee2ee99917c85a5455357e56f8dc4",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6001]={["aftermath"]="Mathrengyl sensed both the spirit's teaching and Lunaclaw's strength, and found no further obstacle to teaching the Claw's form.",["atomIDs"]={"6001:description:1-50","6001:description:53-111","6001:description:114-209","6001:description:212-288","6001:description:293-352","6001:description:354-470","6001:objective:1-84","6001:objective:87-174","6001:objective:179-242"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6001:completion:1-68","6001:completion:70-199","6001:completion:204-248","6001:completion:250-310"},["opening"]="Mathrengyl provided moondust to call Lunaclaw at the moonkin stone near Auberdine. Facing its defender would test the strength of body and heart required of the Claw.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to summon and face Lunaclaw before returning to Mathrengyl.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the completed trial of Lunaclaw to Mathrengyl.",["sourceHash"]="c14c0df84b0072e73895d4f75a2d25049890bffc830152259cc986d5fefebc9f",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6002]={["aftermath"]="Turak recognized the spirit's lesson and Lunaclaw's strength, and prepared the pupil's entry into the Claw.",["atomIDs"]={"6002:description:1-98","6002:description:101-158","6002:description:161-247","6002:description:250-326","6002:description:331-391","6002:description:393-509","6002:objective:1-104","6002:objective:107-194","6002:objective:199-260"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6002:completion:1-68","6002:completion:70-199","6002:completion:204-248","6002:completion:250-310"},["opening"]="Turak's lunardust could call Lunaclaw at the stone between Mulgore and the Barrens. The encounter would test whether the pupil could possess the defender's strength.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to face Lunaclaw and return to Turak.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Turak after completing Lunaclaw's trial.",["sourceHash"]="aa01eecbfacc81031dd536e6a793f6dbf26763f5f52abe98a46833792ed6083c",["sourceRaceMask"]="32",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6004]={["aftermath"]="Kirsta thanked the help and condemned the Crusade's violence against those outside its loyalty, including innocents.",["atomIDs"]={"6004:description:1-88","6004:description:90-174","6004:description:176-288","6004:description:293-344","6004:description:346-417","6004:description:419-492","6004:objective:1-140"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6004:completion:1-14","6004:completion:16-57","6004:completion:59-68","6004:completion:73-153","6004:completion:155-304","6004:completion:306-320"},["opening"]="Kirsta's scouting mission had left her unable to continue without rest. She sought help against the outlying Scarlet camp before considering a more difficult goal inside Hearthglen.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront the four types of Scarlet defender.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Kirsta's first assignment.",["sourceHash"]="76cb7e9f03df32a30c09fce9ccc5d42db93aa19c4aaf81fa27481ba5ad48db4e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6021]={["aftermath"]="Alen welcomed the leader's removal and hoped the gang had learned from it.",["atomIDs"]={"6021:description:1-73","6021:description:75-109","6021:description:112-154","6021:description:159-192","6021:description:195-213","6021:description:218-428","6021:description:433-467","6021:description:470-503","6021:objective:1-63"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6021:completion:1-19","6021:completion:21-64"},["opening"]="Alen's burial pit was being robbed at night. He identified Zaeldarr's undead trolls as the thieves carrying bodies back to the Undercroft and demanded their leader's head.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Zaeldarr's head to Alen.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the outcast's head.",["sourceHash"]="b68ae7efcb035e8aa660c6616c3bfcafd1a9512332d4fb25f3254c01d1a723c7",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6022]={["aftermath"]="Nathanos accepted that the hounds would have food, despite his expressed hope that the errand would have failed.",["atomIDs"]={"6022:description:1-51","6022:description:56-92","6022:description:97-155","6022:description:157-225","6022:description:227-271","6022:description:273-353","6022:description:355-389","6022:description:394-485","6022:description:487-508","6022:objective:1-87","6022:objective:89-139","6022:objective:141-210"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6022:completion:1-14","6022:completion:16-74","6022:completion:79-95","6022:completion:100-148"},["opening"]="Nathanos's first demand at the stead was food for his hounds. Fresh rot from Corin's Crossing had to be gathered quickly and ground before it lost the living quality needed for coagulation.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to collect the rot in time and grind it.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the coagulated rot to Nathanos.",["sourceHash"]="b06495a86a4b5fcfb69bbe75853138d35baa5c71bb0cf9e9d35f555e42142aa6",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6023]={["aftermath"]="Kirsta remained exhausted and uncertain how she could carry out the final reconnaissance.",["atomIDs"]={"6023:description:1-122","6023:description:124-212","6023:description:214-401","6023:description:403-439","6023:description:441-501","6023:objective:1-102"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6023:completion:1-14","6023:completion:16-65","6023:completion:67-106","6023:completion:108-183","6023:completion:188-312","6023:completion:317-379","6023:completion:381-405","6023:completion:407-422"},["opening"]="Kirsta identified Radley and Durgen as the backbone of the forces outside town. Removing them would advance the mission she was still too weak to undertake herself.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront both leaders on the pass.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the paired assignment.",["sourceHash"]="866a446f1c66d84a144768c98c9f54dcfdfa49ece3d84549c6a7104f07a3743f",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6024]={["atomIDs"]={"6024:description:1-8","6024:description:11-31","6024:description:36-47","6024:description:50-118","6024:description:120-134","6024:description:137-152","6024:description:157-248","6024:description:251-317","6024:description:322-410","6024:description:413-427","6024:description:430-467","6024:description:472-479","6024:description:482-502","6024:objective:1-24","6024:objective:27-81"},["opening"]="Hameya wrote before the infection overcame his will. The lich's command was driving him toward his own people, and he asked to be stopped, offering the key to a buried chest as the means to reward that intervention.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to stop Hameya and use his key.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} opened the buried chest with Hameya's key.",["sourceHash"]="f554f96d69dbed5fa99d0178f6f5de7745b068f3e571d6b3bd3740c43668a671",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6025]={["aftermath"]="Kirsta planned to return to Stormwind and briefly let Elling's name slip while giving thanks.",["atomIDs"]={"6025:description:1-5","6025:description:7-13","6025:description:15-36","6025:description:38-80","6025:description:82-149","6025:description:154-170","6025:description:172-303","6025:description:308-422","6025:description:424-489","6025:description:491-508","6025:objective:1-175"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6025:completion:1-19","6025:completion:21-30","6025:completion:35-58","6025:completion:60-93","6025:completion:95-148","6025:completion:150-184","6025:completion:186-209"},["opening"]="Kirsta accepted an offer to enter Hearthglen on her behalf while warning that she could supply neither protection nor useful knowledge of its interior. A high viewpoint would allow a count of its forces.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to survey the town from a high position.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the reconnaissance findings.",["sourceHash"]="7cc9488bec848e2832923650ee0edd1c45da90c2fe5099218cf9cfb91f45faac",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6026]={["aftermath"]="Smokey offered half the pay before the remaining demolition work and half afterward.",["atomIDs"]={"6026:description:1-93","6026:description:95-131","6026:description:133-204","6026:description:206-221","6026:description:226-318","6026:description:320-414","6026:description:416-455","6026:description:457-498","6026:description:500-504","6026:objective:1-106","6026:objective:111-177"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6026:completion:1-58"},["opening"]="The Dawn had hired Smokey to demolish Scourge buildings. He offered to divide the commission if another worker assembled the metal and engineered components while he arranged the targets.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather Smokey's bomb components.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the bars, rod, bombs and triggers.",["sourceHash"]="def4bd1cff5bb9df173ce2ec960b3938a4fc2be98f0a27cf151c0e6fab556a56",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6027]={["aftermath"]="Azore undertook to pass the recovered volume to the high council.",["atomIDs"]={"6027:description:1-46","6027:description:48-142","6027:description:144-212","6027:description:214-299","6027:description:302-369","6027:objective:1-90"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6027:completion:1-35","6027:completion:37-93","6027:completion:95-155","6027:completion:157-184"},["opening"]="Azore entrusted a gem for the statue on Ranazjar Isle. Placing it would summon the guardian of a book said to preserve centuries of naga secrets.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to summon the guardian and recover the book.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the ancient book to Azore.",["sourceHash"]="931b2671a0c298b126fe58e5b1536e188d5688ebdbdf1eb62d83d577a1e2b87d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6028]={["aftermath"]="Pureheart praised Gregor's skill in negotiations with the cartel and acknowledged the delivery.",["atomIDs"]={"6028:description:1-96","6028:description:99-194","6028:description:197-359","6028:description:364-488","6028:objective:1-95"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6028:completion:1-28","6028:completion:30-156","6028:completion:158-309","6028:completion:311-364","6028:completion:369-430","6028:completion:432-465"},["opening"]="Gregor represented the Dawn in Everlook's local affairs. His progress report needed to reach Pureheart, joining commercial diplomacy in the snow to the campaign at Chillwind.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the report to Pureheart.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought it to Chillwind.",["sourceHash"]="7de5a8cb3f80f5bb3a807b2f19891f5a8f5d799dd2b0b6cbf4f9cfa56e64abb7",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6029]={["aftermath"]="Garush recognized Gregor's resourcefulness with goblin diplomacy and thanked the courier.",["atomIDs"]={"6029:description:1-95","6029:description:98-193","6029:description:196-376","6029:description:381-505","6029:objective:1-89"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6029:completion:1-35","6029:completion:38-164","6029:completion:167-318","6029:completion:321-374","6029:completion:379-440","6029:completion:443-476"},["opening"]="Gregor sent another report route toward Garush at the Bulwark. A responsible courier could carry the Dawn's account and establish contact with its western officer.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring Garush the Everlook report.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it at the Bulwark.",["sourceHash"]="16f9f4c86275e325e2233986ad78592bda8471e25f313b3609a9d31064204e33",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6030]={["aftermath"]="The duke judged it possibly illuminating but unresolved and undertook to decipher it.",["atomIDs"]={"6030:description:1-127","6030:description:129-226","6030:description:231-322","6030:description:325-384","6030:description:387-491","6030:objective:1-120"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6030:completion:1-7","6030:completion:9-56","6030:completion:58-182","6030:completion:187-236","6030:completion:241-328","6030:completion:330-360","6030:completion:362-374","6030:completion:376-423","6030:completion:425-500"},["opening"]="Umbranse's book baffled Gregor despite its impressive length. Zverenhoff's linguistic skill was the reason to carry the medium's work toward Light's Hope for examination.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver the spirit-speaking study.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the volume to Zverenhoff.",["sourceHash"]="2158294ae639ec540c19510c98bded9941f34c916a873679159a68e2ba39e7ee",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6031]={["atomIDs"]={"6031:description:1-29","6031:description:32-56","6031:description:59-103","6031:description:108-194","6031:description:197-300","6031:description:305-332","6031:description:335-398","6031:objective:1-48"},["opening"]="Timbermaw's caution had protected it from strangers but limited trade. A visiting friend's cloak introduced runecloth that Meilosh now wanted for his people's garments.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring thirty runecloth.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the cloth to Meilosh.",["sourceHash"]="ab7a3dbe37abce327a16269e94beac5f66dd8965bd209ecc7190ee882c39de68",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6032]={["aftermath"]="Meilosh accepted it for holy garments and prepared to teach the technique.",["atomIDs"]={"6032:description:1-90","6032:description:93-116","6032:description:121-215","6032:objective:1-47"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6032:completion:1-14","6032:completion:16-77","6032:completion:79-92","6032:completion:94-114"},["opening"]="Meilosh distinguished sacred mooncloth from the pleasing but ordinary runecloth. A small supply of the holy material would earn instruction in a guarded fashioning technique.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to provide two mooncloth.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the sacred cloth.",["sourceHash"]="62a7acb523780e1b4e663d21dff4f4e4d7b582820aa1238b755172ef6396a05d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6041]={["atomIDs"]={"6041:description:1-119","6041:description:124-196","6041:description:198-323","6041:description:328-354","6041:description:359-363","6041:description:365-384","6041:objective:1-48","6041:objective:50-168","6041:objective:170-225","6041:objective:230-302","6041:objective:307-356","6041:objective:358-366"},["opening"]="Smokey's people had marked the ziggurats and slaughterhouses. Ten unstable charges were supplied for eight structures, with the marks inside each building indicating where the compounds should be planted.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to demolish eight marked structures.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the demolition and returned to Smokey.",["sourceHash"]="b21878ce2af0fcef1a451f974162244b2e83a938d88a59f1d97def442132947b",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6042]={["atomIDs"]={"6042:description:1-92","6042:description:94-205","6042:description:207-302","6042:description:304-324","6042:description:329-333","6042:description:335-348","6042:description:350-371","6042:description:373-473","6042:description:475-494","6042:objective:1-55","6042:objective:57-110"},["opening"]="Nathanos wanted fewer bats interrupting hunts with his hounds. He cast this nuisance work as training and demanded larger, more dangerous plaguebats than those near an ordinary camp.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront the noxious and monstrous bats.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Nathanos's bat assignment.",["sourceHash"]="4666835b5b8ad1052ad5707d1de6f29e6effb4761970647a1169414a0af6cfe3",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6061]={["aftermath"]="Yaw read signs of approval from the Earthmother.",["atomIDs"]={"6061:description:1-100","6061:description:102-214","6061:description:219-314","6061:description:316-375","6061:description:377-433","6061:description:435-503","6061:objective:1-49","6061:objective:51-137"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6061:completion:1-67"},["opening"]="Yaw linked the tauren hunt to the Earthmother and the spirits of mighty creatures. A plainstrider would begin the practice needed to make a beast a companion.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to tame an adult plainstrider with Yaw's rod.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Yaw's rod after taming and practicing with the plainstrider.",["sourceHash"]="55dab6d51df7c5d8dd5384a684273f2241df38f89fed3ea596eba32fbb06f404",["sourceRaceMask"]="32",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6062]={["aftermath"]="Thotar accepted the work and judged the pupil ready for another task.",["atomIDs"]={"6062:description:1-64","6062:description:66-172","6062:description:177-287","6062:description:292-378","6062:description:380-423","6062:description:425-501","6062:objective:1-47","6062:objective:49-121"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6062:completion:1-23","6062:completion:25-67"},["opening"]="Thotar taught that a hunter had to learn the force within another creature. A dire mottled boar near Razor Hill would provide the first exercise in control and cooperation.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to tame a dire mottled boar and practice beside it.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the taming rod to Thotar after the boar exercise.",["sourceHash"]="5370725553887c15ec3cb6dd9bd2f319593261c448236e99a92ba489df82cb8f",["sourceRaceMask"]="130",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6063]={["aftermath"]="Dazalar praised the speed of learning.",["atomIDs"]={"6063:description:1-83","6063:description:85-242","6063:description:247-364","6063:description:369-411","6063:description:413-463","6063:description:465-510","6063:objective:1-44","6063:objective:46-117"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6063:completion:1-14","6063:completion:16-44"},["opening"]="Dazalar insisted that nature required respect rather than submission to desire. His first test used a webwood lurker to measure readiness for the responsibility of a companion.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to tame a webwood lurker with Dazalar's rod.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Dazalar after taming and practicing with the lurker.",["sourceHash"]="709ee7b1ecb2b197ee5356b5d657855d5f106a7d9eb300f33e2a09b4c539b45d",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6064]={["aftermath"]="Grif turned eagerly toward the next lesson.",["atomIDs"]={"6064:description:1-22","6064:description:24-87","6064:description:92-115","6064:description:117-254","6064:description:256-332","6064:description:337-433","6064:description:435-497","6064:objective:1-45","6064:objective:47-125"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6064:completion:1-57"},["opening"]="Grif proposed trying different creatures before choosing a lasting companion. The first lesson called for a large crag boar and practice with the taming rod.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to tame a large crag boar and return to Grif.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned Grif's rod after practice with the crag boar.",["sourceHash"]="f6a6cf16526f95fdf0aa7515d7ef36070484d83c0f674f3acc2f69d6c1cad7d1",["sourceRaceMask"]="4",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6065]={["aftermath"]="Yaw agreed that the pupil was ready.",["atomIDs"]={"6065:description:1-20","6065:description:22-113","6065:description:118-165","6065:description:167-222","6065:objective:1-46"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6065:completion:1-34"},["opening"]="Kary judged the young hunter ready to handle an animal companion. Yaw in Bloodhoof Village could begin the training needed to earn one.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Yaw in Bloodhoof Village.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Yaw Sharpmane in Bloodhoof Village.",["sourceHash"]="102fd596b36f0e3b9ae9e475eddf6267f5f9af4b672bc4b934d8a2c02b9d4dbd",["sourceRaceMask"]="32",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6066]={["aftermath"]="Yaw recognized readiness for the training.",["atomIDs"]={"6066:description:1-20","6066:description:22-113","6066:description:118-165","6066:description:167-222","6066:objective:1-46"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6066:completion:1-34"},["opening"]="Lanka directed the next stage of a hunter's training to Yaw. The teacher in Bloodhoof Village would begin the path toward an animal companion.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to seek Yaw's instruction.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Yaw in Bloodhoof Village.",["sourceHash"]="dc6350cc62ebd321f8004b63ddc143b223da9e53694a6488e8f5c2e8c1df1fb0",["sourceRaceMask"]="32",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
