[6121]={["aftermath"]="Dendrite assigned a real poisoning crisis in Auberdine, where the village had requested help for its animals.",["atomIDs"]={"6121:description:1-83","6121:description:86-193","6121:description:196-234","6121:description:236-339","6121:description:344-442","6121:objective:1-83"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6121:completion:1-93","6121:completion:98-201","6121:completion:203-308","6121:completion:310-414","6121:completion:416-470","6121:completion:472-489"},["opening"]="Mathrengyl wanted the gift of curing poison understood before it was granted. Dendrite would teach the effort ordinary people endured without the aid of a druid's incantation.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to seek Dendrite's lesson in Moonglade.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Dendrite in Nighthaven.",["sourceHash"]="fb2ad7c61f7cf47cfe7fa530d9cbe222f43ab43a7987839959c0f85ff446b2d7",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6122]={["aftermath"]="Alanndarian found the water badly polluted and suspected more than one cause. She planned to study it while using it as the base for a cure.",["atomIDs"]={"6122:description:1-211","6122:description:214-341","6122:description:346-407","6122:description:410-498","6122:objective:1-106","6122:objective:111-204"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6122:completion:1-35","6122:completion:37-64","6122:completion:69-156","6122:completion:158-223","6122:completion:225-336","6122:completion:341-401","6122:completion:403-479"},["opening"]="Dendrite suspected Darkshore's drinking water as a source of the deer sickness. A sample from Cliffspring Falls would begin the investigation with Alanndarian in Auberdine.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to sample the falls and carry the water to Alanndarian.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the filled Cliffspring sampler to Alanndarian.",["sourceHash"]="0c004012c5cbb47689bfb2c8cc7b9be6c15a382cd07fc41c59bc8a66c5e5f5d7",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6123]={["aftermath"]="Alanndarian found enough material to begin making useful doses, stressing the difficulty of matching an antidote to a particular poison.",["atomIDs"]={"6123:description:1-78","6123:description:81-127","6123:description:130-244","6123:description:249-294","6123:description:297-401","6123:description:404-479","6123:objective:1-111"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6123:completion:1-140","6123:completion:145-276","6123:completion:278-402","6123:completion:407-438"},["opening"]="Alanndarian needed earthroot for the salve's curative properties and lunar fungus for its potency. The plants would join the water sample in an attempt to treat the sick deer.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring five earthroot and twelve lunar funguses.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Alanndarian with the earthroot and fungus.",["sourceHash"]="9f68a3179ac853ed30c46cc6b69cd05fe073aefe64355877d9fdbb1beacc63ce",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6124]={["aftermath"]="Dendrite praised the care given to victims of a wider corruption and urged the pupil to recognize the threat where others might ignore it.",["atomIDs"]={"6124:description:1-93","6124:description:96-203","6124:description:206-288","6124:description:293-376","6124:description:379-442","6124:description:444-507","6124:objective:1-113","6124:objective:116-297"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6124:completion:1-166","6124:completion:169-235","6124:completion:237-285","6124:completion:288-376","6124:completion:381-486"},["opening"]="Alanndarian had made ten doses of salve. While Auberdine worked toward more, she asked for a first round of treatment among Darkshore's sick deer and a report to Dendrite.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to treat ten sickly deer and report to Dendrite.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Dendrite after applying the salve to ten sickly deer.",["sourceHash"]="525310a7ef44194861faa1dca81ef6ba63506ae50e0b3c39075644475944fc16",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6125]={["aftermath"]="Mathrengyl called for further investigation of Auberdine's poisonings and offered lasting power to cure poison in recognition of the service.",["atomIDs"]={"6125:description:1-81","6125:description:84-202","6125:description:207-270","6125:description:273-395","6125:description:400-421","6125:description:424-444","6125:objective:1-67"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6125:completion:1-155","6125:completion:158-290","6125:completion:295-341","6125:completion:344-430","6125:completion:433-450","6125:completion:452-463"},["opening"]="Dendrite considered the practical lesson complete. Before receiving spiritual power over poison, the pupil was to remember the labor others faced in finding a cure.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to return to Mathrengyl in Darnassus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Mathrengyl in the Cenarion Enclave.",["sourceHash"]="d18a92d4213e1635bc2f0df32e8944bf862a7063767ec798cbed01c41393c818",["sourceRaceMask"]="8",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6126]={["aftermath"]="Dendrite explained that the Crossroads had requested help for poisoned animals. The lesson would answer a real crisis.",["atomIDs"]={"6126:description:1-83","6126:description:86-193","6126:description:196-234","6126:description:236-339","6126:description:344-442","6126:objective:1-83"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6126:completion:1-96","6126:completion:101-204","6126:completion:206-327","6126:completion:329-415","6126:completion:417-471","6126:completion:473-490"},["opening"]="Turak wished the ease of a druid's cure to be measured against the work of ordinary healing. He sent the pupil to Dendrite for a lesson in poison and its consequences.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to seek Dendrite in Moonglade.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Dendrite in Nighthaven.",["sourceHash"]="d1f8ce481a2e2e38e95b5cd71bdc410bfc6fbbc7def79a042a619267e4d8ddf8",["sourceRaceMask"]="32",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6127]={["aftermath"]="Tonga found the water badly polluted, linked it to the gazelles' sickness, and suspected another influence as well. The sample could still help form a cure.",["atomIDs"]={"6127:description:1-130","6127:description:133-203","6127:description:206-279","6127:description:284-356","6127:description:359-419","6127:description:422-509","6127:objective:1-98","6127:objective:103-190"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6127:completion:1-42","6127:completion:44-75","6127:completion:80-175","6127:completion:177-245","6127:completion:247-358","6127:completion:363-423","6127:completion:425-501"},["opening"]="Dendrite suspected the Burning Blade had tainted the pools on Dreadmist Peak. A sample from the summit would give Tonga at the Crossroads a beginning for the investigation.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to sample the summit pool and bring the water to Tonga.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the filled Dreadmist sampler to Tonga.",["sourceHash"]="0ebfda682c29c786c6eeb87226dbc5c5a422e0170faf39e2882c2a9540b15b70",["sourceRaceMask"]="32",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6128]={["aftermath"]="Tonga judged the materials sufficient to begin making the salve and explained the exacting nature of antidotes.",["atomIDs"]={"6128:description:1-85","6128:description:88-134","6128:description:137-250","6128:description:255-337","6128:description:340-484","6128:objective:1-104"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6128:completion:1-140","6128:completion:145-276","6128:completion:278-402","6128:completion:407-438"},["opening"]="Tonga planned to combine earthroot and whole kodo horns with the sampled water. Fragments would not provide the potency required for a salve against the gazelles' sickness.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather five earthroot and five kodo horns for Tonga.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Tonga with the required plants and horns.",["sourceHash"]="8f9cc1ead07f02987cc6d3f9b56056f2a3a4dd1d5fc1c004c9765617a4979a40",["sourceRaceMask"]="32",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6129]={["aftermath"]="Dendrite recognized service to nature and praised the tauren's demonstration that the need for balance crossed racial boundaries.",["atomIDs"]={"6129:description:1-60","6129:description:63-176","6129:description:179-276","6129:description:281-364","6129:description:367-422","6129:description:424-487","6129:objective:1-140","6129:objective:143-238"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6129:completion:1-172","6129:completion:174-347","6129:completion:352-450"},["opening"]="Tonga had prepared ten doses while seeking help to make more. The first treatments were needed among the sick gazelles north of the Crossroads road.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to treat ten sickly gazelles and return to Dendrite.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported to Dendrite after applying the salve to ten sickly gazelles.",["sourceHash"]="7d4f08ce3ef4e4561c3260f852457a7d49b2a383ce7b91b7cd6e9717aefb7afb",["sourceRaceMask"]="32",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6130]={["aftermath"]="Turak called the Crossroads poisonings a threat to balance deserving further investigation, and offered permanent power over poison.",["atomIDs"]={"6130:description:1-81","6130:description:84-202","6130:description:207-268","6130:description:271-393","6130:description:398-419","6130:description:422-442","6130:objective:1-59"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6130:completion:1-160","6130:completion:162-294","6130:completion:299-345","6130:completion:347-428","6130:completion:430-447","6130:completion:449-460"},["opening"]="Dendrite sent the pupil back to Turak with an understanding of poison's demands on ordinary healers. The coming gift was to be remembered in light of that work.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return to Turak in Thunder Bluff.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Turak on the Elder Rise.",["sourceHash"]="72bd8b6e1f6d96e18f009a70b2ed96fb3b17392a96a56e246c89b8575c8018ae",["sourceRaceMask"]="32",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6132]={["aftermath"]="Hornizz confirmed hearing from Melizza before the report arrived.",["atomIDs"]={"6132:description:1-19","6132:description:24-83","6132:description:86-136","6132:description:138-165","6132:description:168-195","6132:description:200-258","6132:description:261-317","6132:description:322-337","6132:description:340-428","6132:objective:1-96"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6132:completion:1-39","6132:completion:42-165"},["opening"]="Melizza's proposed business with the Maraudine had ended in captivity. She feared their cooking preparations and offered her brother's payment for a way out.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to escort Melizza and find Hornizz.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Melizza's escape and spoke with her brother.",["sourceHash"]="2c339373249a2ab1c11ed39871de6ac2f4dfda6d43ef411fb6a6411aff77ec82",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6133]={["atomIDs"]={"6133:description:1-126","6133:description:131-203","6133:description:205-254","6133:description:259-339","6133:description:341-363","6133:objective:1-95","6133:objective:97-144","6133:objective:149-209"},["opening"]="The elves at Quel'Lithien held a record of Nathanos's mortal life. He demanded it back while explicitly denying permission to read it, pairing recovery with an attack on the lodge's defenders.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the registry and fulfill the lodge assignment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the registry after the assigned attack.",["sourceHash"]="b76b10d1349d64ac7a2c842e12d050804a5aa84f0b0bda897ec2ecbf50e20af2",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6134]={["aftermath"]="Hornizz admitted that profit still depended on convincing the centaur what the substance was.",["atomIDs"]={"6134:description:1-81","6134:description:84-108","6134:description:111-151","6134:description:154-243","6134:description:248-286","6134:description:289-399","6134:description:402-506","6134:objective:1-88"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6134:completion:1-12","6134:completion:15-55","6134:completion:58-74","6134:completion:79-121","6134:completion:124-160","6134:completion:162-203"},["opening"]="Hornizz hoped to sell captured ghost energy to the Magram. His magnets would draw spirits between the valley's giant skeletons, where their residue could be gathered.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to collect eight ghost-o-plasms and return the magnets.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the residue and equipment to Hornizz.",["sourceHash"]="ad607776c97e62f28e7ec3d16d3e23585a4c58bdfd6125ac2ab9f707a1ce8e3f",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6135]={["aftermath"]="Nathanos planned to fashion the fur into something useful.",["atomIDs"]={"6135:description:1-101","6135:description:106-160","6135:description:162-167","6135:description:169-241","6135:description:246-318","6135:description:320-350","6135:description:352-420","6135:objective:1-27","6135:objective:29-118","6135:objective:123-198"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6135:completion:1-25","6135:completion:27-78"},["opening"]="Nathanos offered a more involved challenge after the earlier missions. Duskwing's white fur would prove a successful hunt for the albino bat roaming north of the stead.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover a patch of white fur.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Duskwing's fur to Nathanos.",["sourceHash"]="41dc2938e4442fb7b80ef9113598b1b7bf5185ffefcfdc751dfd7ff0628822ab",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6136]={["atomIDs"]={"6136:description:1-123","6136:description:128-170","6136:description:172-196","6136:description:198-246","6136:description:251-363","6136:description:365-428","6136:objective:1-77","6136:objective:79-139"},["opening"]="Borelgore's appetite had already cost Nathanos entire regiments, by his account. The enormous creature north of the chapel remained a danger to those sent to hunt it.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront Borelgore.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the hunt and reported to Nathanos.",["sourceHash"]="ad1faa7e84189d5883abd7f8e15a294302e7fc76bc7bf83bdd1232fd08891454",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6141]={["atomIDs"]={"6141:description:1-122","6141:description:125-210","6141:description:215-278","6141:description:281-325","6141:description:328-384","6141:objective:1-37"},["opening"]="Rumors of undead had drawn Anton across the sea to Desolace. Crowley directed prospective aid toward the crusader at Nijel's Point.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to meet Anton in Desolace.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Anton at Nijel's Point.",["sourceHash"]="8a86b211c0b689763ff8ad70e6ca65f2219253410d3809e0bcf15ff054e2d75c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6142]={["aftermath"]="Mai'Lahii connected the planned fishing to a witchdoctor's advice for his headache.",["atomIDs"]={"6142:description:1-37","6142:description:39-80","6142:description:82-178","6142:description:183-234","6142:description:236-287","6142:description:289-382","6142:objective:1-94"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6142:completion:1-78","6142:completion:80-110","6142:completion:112-139","6142:completion:144-183"},["opening"]="Mai'Lahii praised soft-shelled clam meat as bait. Clams near the northern wreck offered the supply needed for another fishing trip.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather ten pieces of clam meat.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the bait to Mai'Lahii.",["sourceHash"]="bf11a5c65f1d3523a0bcc4261b90fac8994f984b714e70c3331eeadc8ddbb08d",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6143]={["aftermath"]="The news did not ease Drulzegar's emptiness, and he spoke of pursuing revenge for the rest of his life.",["atomIDs"]={"6143:description:1-39","6143:description:41-139","6143:description:141-246","6143:description:251-311","6143:description:316-399","6143:description:401-475","6143:objective:1-136"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6143:completion:1-98","6143:completion:100-169","6143:completion:174-209","6143:completion:211-315"},["opening"]="Drulzegar alone survived the naga attack on his fishing crew. His request for retaliation came from grief and guilt over those lost near Ranazjar Isle.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront the three Slitherblade groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Drulzegar's assignment against the naga.",["sourceHash"]="132cd49328fd3a129343296f97a72ad581cb78e821c08460480db7bde757dd78",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6144]={["aftermath"]="Varimathras named Sylvanas's command to act against the Grand Crusader sheltered in Stratholme.",["atomIDs"]={"6144:description:1-28","6144:description:30-164","6144:description:169-239","6144:description:241-299","6144:description:304-335","6144:description:340-397","6144:description:399-422","6144:objective:1-51"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6144:completion:1-156","6144:completion:161-234","6144:completion:236-294"},["opening"]="Varimathras requested capable agents for a sensitive operation. Nathanos's contempt for his remaining recruits did not change the order to report to the Undercity.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to answer the summons from Varimathras.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Varimathras.",["sourceHash"]="171a9680813ec5ab0304b2b0470b95a2daf220074c29174b974899ec06628f4e",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6145]={["aftermath"]="Nathanos saw an opportunity to expose and destroy the Scarlet Oracle.",["atomIDs"]={"6145:description:1-91","6145:description:93-180","6145:description:182-236","6145:description:241-336","6145:description:338-405","6145:description:407-433","6145:description:435-483","6145:description:485-506","6145:objective:1-65","6145:objective:67-124","6145:objective:129-194"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6145:completion:1-18","6145:completion:23-32","6145:completion:34-41","6145:completion:43-87"},["opening"]="Stratholme's leadership was too well defended for a direct approach. Daily reports to Tyr's Hand offered a vulnerable connection outside the fortress and the first step in Varimathras's plan.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover the courier's report for Nathanos.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Grand Crusader's command.",["sourceHash"]="ca7fbd09d221c6d3d2c164a74053c8a0a3f6dd211d3110d0beda38c21cc9dbfa",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6146]={["aftermath"]="Valdelmar accepted the courier's appearance and asked why the return had taken so long.",["atomIDs"]={"6146:description:1-45","6146:description:47-131","6146:description:136-157","6146:description:159-222","6146:description:227-230","6146:description:232-273","6146:description:278-330","6146:description:332-375","6146:description:377-417","6146:description:419-442","6146:description:444-504","6146:objective:1-52","6146:objective:54-97","6146:objective:99-208"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6146:completion:1-20","6146:completion:22-65"},["opening"]="Nathanos altered the order to draw the Oracle into view. A rotten apple supplied the disguise needed to hand the forged command directly to Valdelmar at Tyr's Hand.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver the altered command under its disguise.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the disguised delivery.",["sourceHash"]="564c7229762cdb3fffa04d812847ce913b0232df80d9129355bb8bb0b4648a99",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6147]={["aftermath"]="Nathanos judged the deception unnoticed and prepared to strike.",["atomIDs"]={"6147:description:1-44","6147:description:46-63","6147:description:65-90","6147:description:92-177","6147:description:182-262","6147:objective:1-57"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6147:completion:1-10","6147:completion:12-39","6147:completion:41-61","6147:completion:63-95"},["opening"]="Valdelmar questioned the unusual order but agreed to comply. He promised to send the Oracle to Stratholme under careful protection, giving the disguised courier news for the waiting conspirator.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to relay the planned movement to Nathanos.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported Valdelmar's response.",["sourceHash"]="35515f26a423dbef216207b9a995905d6c3c45295bc0134d3857204ce468bfe2",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6161]={["aftermath"]="The opened chest revealed Rackmore's treasure.",["atomIDs"]={"6161:description:1-120","6161:description:123-211","6161:description:216-272","6161:description:275-355","6161:objective:1-27","6161:objective:30-56","6161:objective:59-89"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6161:completion:1-42"},["opening"]="Rackmore's log described a chest hidden before attackers could seize it. Two lost keys, silver and gold, stood between the concealed island cache and its opening.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find both keys and the chest.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} opened Rackmore's chest with the recovered keys.",["sourceHash"]="02b1c53e9e96763a9e7bd311604155b116cef4331a76578655360626331d207a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6162]={["aftermath"]="She honored her husband's death in battle but said she could not rest until the creature paid for it.",["atomIDs"]={"6162:description:1-124","6162:description:129-324","6162:description:329-362","6162:description:364-403","6162:description:405-445","6162:description:447-472","6162:objective:1-81"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6162:completion:1-59","6162:completion:61-120","6162:completion:122-240","6162:completion:245-264"},["opening"]="Dreka'Sur's last letter from her husband concerned a druid and Overlord Ror. Neither returned, leaving the widow to demand the furbolg's claw as payment for the loss.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover Ror's claw.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the claw to Dreka'Sur.",["sourceHash"]="348cbfef3c3060664a5fc4e0f2361ef81d5f71905df939c190140a158c5184ff",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6163]={["aftermath"]="Nathanos declared that the trophy would hang on his wall and saluted a new place among his champions.",["atomIDs"]={"6163:description:1-18","6163:description:20-49","6163:description:51-89","6163:description:91-156","6163:description:161-171","6163:description:173-182","6163:description:184-250","6163:description:255-272","6163:description:274-300","6163:description:302-344","6163:description:349-366","6163:description:368-404","6163:description:406-410","6163:description:415-498","6163:description:500-510","6163:objective:1-50","6163:objective:52-92"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6163:completion:1-11","6163:completion:13-33","6163:completion:35-62","6163:completion:67-83","6163:completion:88-130","6163:completion:135-189","6163:completion:194-212"},["opening"]="Nathanos remembered the Scourge attack that took his life and the creature looming above him. Freed from the Lich King's control, he demanded vengeance and the creature's head.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to defeat the Gorger in Stratholme and return its head.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the Gorger's head to Nathanos.",["sourceHash"]="bbb2ecbb09d8442d8cbef06a6924a2eeb967af406d7297eb53fe3bbbb27a4faa",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6164]={["aftermath"]="Augustus delighted in discovering how full the recovered volume was.",["atomIDs"]={"6164:description:1-23","6164:description:26-42","6164:description:47-56","6164:description:58-102","6164:description:105-161","6164:description:166-203","6164:description:206-231","6164:description:233-255","6164:description:260-276","6164:description:279-301","6164:description:304-335","6164:description:338-395","6164:objective:1-67"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6164:completion:1-12","6164:completion:14-23","6164:completion:25-49","6164:completion:54-80","6164:completion:82-92","6164:completion:94-114"},["opening"]="Augustus wanted to reopen his shop but could not account for its business without his receipt book. His old room in town's inn was the place he remembered leaving it.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to recover the missing book.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the receipt book to Augustus.",["sourceHash"]="29543b9f6ea4725830d0fca7ceb0346414ae4e7c0d22f0f35b1b3df10b74fc8e",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6181]={["aftermath"]="Thor offered passage to Stormwind for the delivery.",["atomIDs"]={"6181:description:1-119","6181:description:122-146","6181:description:149-208","6181:description:213-276","6181:description:279-305","6181:description:310-374","6181:description:377-457","6181:objective:1-45"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6181:completion:1-39","6181:completion:41-94"},["opening"]="Sentinel Hill's armor stocks were dwindling. Lewis relied on Osric Strang's Old Town shop rather than regular help from Stormwind, and Thor's gryphons offered the quickest way to put a new request in his hands.",["pending"]="{actor} would take Lewis's note to Thor and arrange its journey to Stormwind.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Lewis's note to Thor.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="cff7cd07705023766536a44d02da731761c26b2bb05f81ceba5944c0c9eb5de7",["sourceRaceMask"]="1",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6182]={["atomIDs"]={"6182:description:1-65","6182:description:67-139","6182:description:144-241","6182:description:243-353","6182:description:358-445","6182:description:447-468","6182:description:470-509","6182:objective:1-46","6182:objective:48-74"},["opening"]="Bolvar recalled Nathanos as the first and last human ranger lord, trained by Sylvanas before the Banshee Queen's present rule. His presumed death lacked a recovered body, and Shaw's investigation might have new evidence.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to consult Shaw about Nathanos Marris.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Mathias Shaw about the Marris investigation.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="9934e58eeae84aa6c7fec6a331721b5e9f06c12ab4bc8ba96987707c00737f9f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6183]={["atomIDs"]={"6183:description:1-59","6183:description:61-124","6183:description:129-209","6183:description:211-264","6183:description:269-370","6183:description:372-465","6183:description:467-480","6183:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Five field agents had entered Shaw's investigation; only one returned and died three days later. Two intelligible words survived his account, Nathanos and Blightcaller, leaving bereaved families without an answer.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to speak with Shaw again about accepting the task.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the follow-up task conversation with Mathias Shaw.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="191a6fbe28b6e27ae4a5229dd770f014abe9dd0c407ff7adc0cf1171d47a6400",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6184]={["aftermath"]="Flint identified the coming mission as reconnaissance.",["atomIDs"]={"6184:description:1-110","6184:description:112-183","6184:description:188-315","6184:description:317-417","6184:description:422-435","6184:objective:1-100"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6184:completion:1-42","6184:completion:44-67","6184:completion:69-76"},["opening"]="Shaw's information only suggested that Nathanos had been killed by the Blightcaller. Assuming the same enemy had destroyed his agents, he referred the next briefing to another operative at Chillwind.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to meet Flint at the camp.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the SI:7 contact.",["sourceHash"]="5e0d80c54e76e2edc8f88205b00440e01911722ad12da306ff05e7819b3aba7c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6185]={["aftermath"]="Flint named Rutger, Fredo and Turyen among the dead and asked what else had been learned.",["atomIDs"]={"6185:description:1-55","6185:description:57-74","6185:description:76-165","6185:description:170-232","6185:description:234-318","6185:description:320-329","6185:description:334-355","6185:description:360-395","6185:description:400-435","6185:description:440-487","6185:objective:1-93","6185:objective:95-176"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6185:completion:1-7","6185:completion:9-14","6185:completion:16-22","6185:completion:24-29","6185:completion:31-37","6185:completion:42-80","6185:completion:85-100","6185:completion:102-176"},["opening"]="Flint's first mission sought evidence rather than another assault. The missing agents were presumed dead, and their insignias could establish what had happened while the Blightcaller investigation continued.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to search for clues and the agents' insignias.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the recovered insignias to Flint.",["sourceHash"]="f8491759b511e60f474682ea559ab91214206847e599fd79427c6783e4dba070",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6186]={["aftermath"]="Fordragon struggled with Nathanos's fate as a Forsaken agent and Sylvanas's champion. The returned intelligence overturned the earlier assumption of an honorable death.",["atomIDs"]={"6186:description:1-65","6186:description:76-93","6186:description:95-123","6186:description:128-131","6186:description:133-141","6186:description:143-188","6186:description:190-247","6186:description:249-285","6186:description:295-400","6186:description:402-450","6186:objective:1-88"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6186:completion:15-18","6186:completion:20-44","6186:completion:46-81","6186:completion:86-130"},["opening"]="Flint struggled to accept Nathanos as the Forsaken's ruthless Blightcaller. The fate of the once-admired ranger lord needed immediate reporting to Fordragon in Stormwind.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to inform Bolvar of Nathanos's fate.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the fate of Nathanos Marris to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="f531c52a58256765c4cfe4b3f1d1cada9497fda6952986d69e2f78dd443b792a",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6187]={["aftermath"]="Bolvar received the outcome as a tragedy of another great figure lost to his people.",["atomIDs"]={"6187:description:1-54","6187:description:56-101","6187:description:106-150","6187:description:152-242","6187:description:247-256","6187:description:258-286","6187:description:295-309","6187:description:311-333","6187:description:338-356","6187:description:358-423","6187:description:428-447","6187:description:449-488","6187:objective:1-55","6187:objective:57-155","6187:objective:160-188","6187:objective:190-249"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"6187:completion:1-16","6187:completion:18-27","6187:completion:29-66","6187:completion:68-160","6187:completion:165-266"},["opening"]="Bolvar remembered Nathanos as an unprecedented human ranger lord and tactical genius. Learning that this former champion now served the Forsaken prompted an order for a major assault, with Horde defenders expected to resist.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to undertake Bolvar's assault on the Blightcaller.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment and reported to Bolvar.",["sourceHash"]="4333b6d316eba951f9b47726d4616db31589d2e7305741174ed91146b3849b32",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[6261]={["aftermath"]="Dungar explained that his gryphons could serve the Westfall route for travelers already acquainted with Thor.",["atomIDs"]={"6261:description:1-58","6261:description:61-83","6261:description:88-173","6261:description:176-242","6261:description:247-313","6261:description:316-398","6261:objective:1-59"},["bridge"]="Osric had gathered the requested armor into a crate. Dungar Longdrink in the Trade District could arrange the return to Westfall, provided the remote gryphon route was already known.",["bridgeFrom"]=6281,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"6261:completion:1-25","6261:completion:27-58","6261:completion:60-98","6261:completion:100-151"},["opening"]="Osric had gathered the requested armor into a crate. Dungar Longdrink in the Trade District could arrange the return to Westfall, provided the remote gryphon route was already known.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take Osric's crate to Dungar Longdrink.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the crate to Dungar in Stormwind.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="360d0f18beb5d639d1d786f7ba7e57875b97fef8d14947aaa154f39e119f74d9",["sourceRaceMask"]="1",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
